      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The article is assigned to general practitioners and devoted to the outpatient combined rehabilitation of coronary heart disease patients, including those after myocardial infarction. In the part concerning the physical rehabilitation there is given the classification of patients by functional classes, the exercise programs of middle intensity for sport and home training. The formula of selection of the walking training temp according to the results of exercise stress test is given. There are presented the psychodiagnostic methods that evaluate the psychological reactions of patients on the disease, and the methods of psychological rehabilitation with use of psychopharmacotherapy. Special part is devoted to the educational program for patients."},
